### Overview
Integrate Snap 2 Fit into the ecosystem as a high-fidelity image auto-pixelation and multi-item print formatting engine. This ensures creator photos scale cleanly from screen resolution to high-DPI physical merchandise without pixelation artifacting.

### 1. Smart Pixelation & Detail Stylization
* Build an image processing engine that handles intentional artistic pixelation, cleaning up graininess while maintaining sharp, crisp color blocks.
* Allow creators to automatically toggle stylistic resolution presets (e.g., retro, sharp vector-edge, or smooth gradients) tailored for merch printing.

### 2. High-Density DPI Sizing Engine (Anti-Blur)
* Automatically intercept standard low-res screen images (72 DPI) and upscale them natively to professional print standards (300 to 450+ DPI).
* Calculate exact pixel dimensions relative to the target item size to ensure fine details do not become muddy or stretched when transferred to physical fabric or materials.

### 3. Universal Item Template Mapping
* Implement an automated canvas wrapper that auto-sizes and reshapes the optimized image to fit perfectly onto any specified product blueprint (t-shirts, hoodies, totes, or accessories) without awkward cropping.
